'''Slaking''' (Japanese: '''ケッキング''' ''Kekking'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

